{"projectInfo":{"name":"分布式VXLAN IP网关配置举例（IPv6网络）","path":"vxlanip","visibility":2,"categoryId":51,"introduction":"VTEP-A、VTEP-C为分布式VXLAN IP网关设备，VTEP-B为与广域网连接的边界网关设备，Internet为广域网内的三层设备。虚拟机VM 1属于VXLAN 10，VM 2属于VXLAN 20。通过分布式VXLAN IP网关实现不同VXLAN网络的三层互联，并通过边界网关实现与广域网的三层互联。具体需求为：不同VTEP之间手工建立VXLAN隧道。手工关联VXLAN和VXLAN隧道。站点之间的泛洪流量采用头端复制的方式转发。","label":["VxLAN ","IPv6","VTEP","vsi"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"VTEP-A","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VTEP-A.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VTEP-B","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VTEP-B.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VTEP-C","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VTEP-C.cfg"},{"resourceName":"P","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\P.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM-1","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM-1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM-2","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM-2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Internet","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Internet.cfg"}]}